# SGC205 ordering-unstated — one sender sends `<Placed>` then `<Paid>`: they
# arrive in send order (per-sender FIFO), so the runs show no reordering. The
# static half still guesses from the two emits (info, a guess).
# expect: info:10:SGC205
#!spec
(User) -> [Shop] : go()
[Shop] ~> <Placed>
[Shop] ~> <Paid>
state {Order} {
  +     -<Placed>->  Open
  Open  -<Paid>->    Settled
}
